 ## License
 
 [BSD-3-Clause](LICENSE)
+
+## Private deployment account compatibility
+
+This private candidate preserves verified gateway accounts from production. Direct Host access uses `$DSH_HOME/pet.json`; a verified issuer and immutable account id use the same SHA-256 directory under `$DSH_HOME/pet-accounts/`. Preserve both directories and `$DSH_HOME/pets` when copying data. Existing names, selections, switches, positions, affinity, treats and gameplay remain in place. New accounts start disabled.
+
+Settings and mutations use the trusted Host `requestPrincipal` service; forged or unverifiable assertions are rejected. Account pets stay idle without Host-wide session bubbles, announcements or plugin action callbacks. The direct Host companion retains those features. Shared asset/catalog reads do not select or mutate another account. Keep the signed gateway and candidate account guards enabled.
